Hi {Owner},

I build websites for translation and document offices around {City}. {Business Name} has loyal clients, but no site where a family can see your prices, languages and exactly what the office does before they come in.

I built a sample first, in English and Spanish, rather than ask for your time: a certified translation price list by document, apostille and legalization steps, a not-a-law-firm notice, a written-contract and receipts section, and a languages page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you'd like it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and price changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
